an errand downtown. Is something the matter?\rdblquote\par
Duke Herhardt gave a slight nod, then turned his gaze from Layla back to Kyle, to whom he flashed a courteous smile.\par
Seeing the duke\rquote s friendly expression, Kyle felt relieved.\par
The duke asked Kyle to pass on his thanks to Kyle\rquote s father for taking such good care of Dowager Herhardt. He then turned to Layla again. Allowing the smile to fade from his lips, he asked, \ldblquote Well, Lady Layla, if Mr. Remmer is out, would you be able to harvest some roses for me?\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote Roses? Roses from the garden?\rdblquote\par
