\ldblquote Where are you going, Mommy?\rdblquote  the little Layla had asked after being given a pretty\rquote  glass jar filled with hard candies. It was the first time she had ever seen such a thing in her life.\par
Looking just as pretty as the candies, her mother had gazed down at Layla for a long while before replying, \ldblquote Far away.\rdblquote\par
\par
\ldblquote Are you coming home late, then?\rdblquote  Layla had impatiently asked, eager to Lasle one of the candies.\par
