Stepping outside, he was greeted by the bright spring sunshine. He got into his car and was driven to downtown Ratse. After meeting with a few more superior officers there, the multi-day discharge process was finally complete.\par
Walking back towards the car, he suddenly stopped in his tracks. He had been caught off guard by the sight of someone walking down the sidewalk on the other side of the street. There was no mistaking her for anyone else, it was Layla.\par
The chauffeur walked up to him. \ldblquote Your Grace?\rdblquote\par
