Forcing a smile, she walked right up to him. She knew she couldn\rquote t fool him with her fake smile when her overall appearance was so disheveled, but she didn\rquote t want to let him see her crying like a fool either. \ldblquote What\rquote s the matter, Uncle Bill?\rdblquote\par
