However, the duke\rquote s face also flashed into her mind when she thought of Arvis, and this made it hard for her to rejoice at the thought of continuing to live there fulltime. She didn\rquote t want to leave Uncle Bill, but she did want to escape the duke. She felt like a fool.\par
\ldblquote Is something the matter again, Layla?\rdblquote  Bill asked.\par
She realized she was frowning. \ldblquote No,\rdblquote  she said, smiling again, her face illuminated by the moonlight. \ldblquote I\rquote m just a bit stunned by the unexpected stroke of luck.\rdblquote\par
