\par
He liked this answer.\par
Checking his wristwatch, he nodded. He\rquote d be back at Arvis by early afternoon at the latest. Getting out of the car, he looked up at the cloudless sky. The sunlight was warm and the breeze was cool.\par
It was the perfect weather for an autumn field trip.\par
